// Game: Postretro
// Format: Standard
// Emissive volumes fixture. Sealed room, interior 448 x 320 x 160 units, wall
// thickness 16. Four plates sit on the north wall, each inside its own
// emissive_volume -- from west to east: a bright bar sign and a dim bar sign,
// both tagged bar_sign, an exit sign tagged exit_sign, and a status lamp with
// a grey glow map tagged status_lamp, authored green.
// emissive-volumes-demo.ts flickers both bar signs, pulses the lamp and fades
// the exit sign up once at load. Two floor pads fire the scripted reactions:
// the west pad fires powerCut, which holds both bar signs dark; the east pad
// fires doorLocked, which turns the lamp red while its pulse runs on.
// Each pad fires once per level load. Reload to test again.
// Compile: cargo run -p postretro-level-compiler -- content/dev/maps/emissive-volumes-demo.map -o content/dev/maps/emissive-volumes-demo.prl
// Run: cargo run -p xtask -- run --features dev-tools -- content/dev/maps/emissive-volumes-demo.prl
// NOTE: keep map comments free of braces and quotes, and never leave a blank
// line inside an entity block -- the .map parser silently drops later entities.
